cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fabel, please cite it as below, together with Ramsay & Silverman (2005)."
type: software
title: "Fabel: functional data analysis for Python"
abstract: >-
  Fabel is a clean-room Python rewrite of the R package fda (version 6.3.0):
  basis expansions, penalised smoothing, functional principal component and
  canonical correlation analysis, functional regression, curve registration
  and principal differential analysis, with numerical parity against R.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: BSD-3-Clause
authors:
  - name: "Hamed Davodi"
    email: hamed.davodi94@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/hameddavodi/fabel"
url: "https://hameddavodi.github.io/fabel"
keywords:
  - functional data analysis
  - fda
  - splines
  - smoothing
  - functional PCA
